<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Universal Health started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Universal Health started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverge of Universal Health Services Inc with near-term accumulate and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 34-1/8.</p>
